(CLAUSE 1: Section 30 & Section 34\(c\)-\(k\) \(Emergency Bund Breach & Flood Mitigation\)) Tj T*
(Where an irrigation tank faces imminent overflow or bund breach risk during) Tj T*
(extreme rainfall, Section 34 empowers the District Disaster Management Authority) Tj T*
(\(District Collector\) to requisition earth-moving machinery, remove unauthorized) Tj T*
(obstructions across surplus escape channels immediately, and evacuate vulnerable) Tj T*
(foreshore/downstream habitations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
